        "endpoint": "Reverse near mid-shin, or earlier when hamstring tension limits the hinge, without touching the floor.",
        "returnPhase": "Drive the hips forward to stand and bring the bar back to the thighs, then begin the next repetition without setting it down.",
        "controlledJoints": "Keep the slight knee bend, straight elbows, and braced spine throughout.",
